 ## Background
-The method is based on the implementation by Hart et al. [Engel 2003] [S1, S2, unofficial]. It was developed to accelerate frequency domain volume rendering on GPUs [S1, S2, unofficial]. The approach leverages the separability of the 2D FFT and the parallel processing capabilities of GPUs [S1, S2, unofficial].
